    "text": "Men \u00fea leofestan, us is deope beboden, \u00fe\u00e6t we geornlice mynegian and l\u00e6ran sculon, \u00fe\u00e6t manna\nSe cwyde is swy\u00f0e egeslic, \u00fee god \u00feurh \u00feone witegan be \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fee godes folce bodian sculon, \u00fe\u00e6t\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0 be \u00feam: clama, ne cesses, et reliqua.\nClypa hlude and hefe up \u00feine stemne and gecy\u00f0 minum folce, \u00fe\u00e6t hi georne fram synnum gecyrren.\nGif \u00f0u \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t ne dest, ac suwast hit and nylt folce his \u00feearfe gecy\u00f0an, \u00feonne scealt \u00f0u ealra \u00fe\u00e6ra\n\u00d0es cwyde m\u00e6g beon swy\u00f0e gemyndelic eallum \u00feam, \u00fee to \u00f0am gesette syn, \u00fe\u00e6t hi godes folce riht\n\u00dee \u00fe\u00e6r\u00e6fter gecweden is.\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0 se witega \u00e6fter \u00feam: gyf \u00feu godes folce riht bodast and \u00feu hit gebigan ne miht to rihte, \u00feonne\nLeofan menn, ic bidde eow, \u00fe\u00e6t ge ge\u00feyldelice hlystan \u00fe\u00e6s, \u00f0e ic nu eow secgan wylle.\nHit is lang to reccenne, \u00fe\u00e6t we on bocum ymbe godes wundra r\u00e6da\u00f0.\nNu wille ic \u00feeah be sumum d\u00e6le sceortlice hit eow sum asecgan.\nUton we gemunan, hu se apostol us manode and l\u00e6rde and \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0: ecce nunc tempus acceptabile; nu\nHw\u00e6t, we witan and leornia\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s beboden on \u00fe\u00e6re ealdan \u00e6, \u00fe\u00e6t manna gehwylc sceolde\nGyf \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feonne hwylc man seo, \u00fe\u00e6t him \u00fe\u00e6t on his mode to une\u00feelic \u00feince, tylige he \u00feonne, la,\nHw\u00e6t, we witan, \u00fe\u00e6t on xii mon\u00feum beo\u00f0 iii hund daga and sixtig daga and fif dagas and eac six tida;\nAnd, gif we \u00feonne \u00fea six sunnandagas of ado\u00f0, \u00fee we sw\u00e6sendo on habba\u00f0, \u00feonne ne bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s f\u00e6stenes\nAnd se man, se \u00f0e wile on \u00e6lce tid heardlice and forwernedlice lyfigean, se bi\u00f0 fulfremed.\nGyf \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feonne hwylc mon sy, \u00fe\u00e6t him on his mode to earfo\u00f0e \u00feince, \u00fe\u00e6t he on \u00e6lce tid swa\nMen \u00fea leofestan, eow eallum is cu\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fees gearlica ymbrene us gebring\u00f0 efne nu \u00fea cl\u00e6nan tid\nNu bidde ic and l\u00e6re \u00e6lcne cristene man, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feas halgan lenctenlice tide gehealde mid cl\u00e6num\nGyf \u00feonne \u00feissa \u00fereora \u00feinga \u00e6nig hwylcne man lette, \u00fe\u00e6t hine to \u00f0am f\u00e6stene ne onhagie, \u00feonne is hit\nGif \u00feonne se hala mid \u00feam unhalan \u00feone mete \u00feicge\u00f0, \u00feonne wur\u00fea\u00f0 hig begen \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6s mettruman\nAnd nis nanum men alefed for nanre neode \u00feis f\u00e6sten to abrecane ne mid \u00e6lmessan to alysenne, buton\nWitodlice \u00feis feowertigfealde f\u00e6sten w\u00e6s asteald on \u00fe\u00e6re ealdan gecy\u00f0nysse, \u00fea \u00fea se heretoga\nEft se m\u00e6ra witega Elias ealswa lang f\u00e6sten \u00feurh godes mihte, swa swa se o\u00f0er, gefylde, and sy\u00f0\u00fean he\nDrihten eac on \u00fe\u00e6re nywan gecy\u00f0nysse f\u00e6ste \u00feurh his godcundan mihte feowertig daga and nihta fram\n\u00d0us w\u00e6s ure lenctenlice f\u00e6sten asteald; ac we ne magan for ure tyddernysse \u00feyllic f\u00e6sten \u00feurhteon.\nNu is us alyfed \u00feurh lareowa ealdordom, \u00fe\u00e6t we d\u00e6ghwamlice on \u00feissere lenctenlican tide ure\nStuntlice f\u00e6st se lenctenlic f\u00e6sten, se \u00f0e on \u00feisum cl\u00e6num timan hine sylfne mid galnysse befyl\u00f0.\nUnrihtlic by\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t se cristena man fl\u00e6sclice lustas gefremme on \u00feam timan, \u00fee he fl\u00e6scmettas forgan\nAnd l\u00e6sse pleoh by\u00f0 \u00feam men, \u00fe\u00e6t he fl\u00e6sces bruce on lenctenf\u00e6stene, \u00feonne he wifes bruce.\nWitodlice on eallum tidum gedafena\u00f0 cristenum mannum, \u00fe\u00e6t hi gode weorc began and \u00e6lmesd\u00e6da,\nSe \u00f0e on o\u00f0rum dagum sleac w\u00e6re to godnysse, he sceal huru\u00feinga on \u00feissum dagum acucian on\nSe \u00f0e \u00e6r gl\u00e6dlice mid godum weorcum hine sylfne geglencde, him gedafena\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he nu on \u00feissum\nNe bi\u00f0 nan f\u00e6sten gode gecweme, buton se man hine sylfne fram leahtrum forh\u00e6bbe.\nCrist sylf cw\u00e6\u00f0 be sumum rican menn on his godspelle; he cw\u00e6\u00f0: sum welig man w\u00e6s on worulde;\n\u00d0a smeade se rica and cw\u00e6\u00f0: hw\u00e6t do ic, la, nu ic n\u00e6bbe, hw\u00e6r ic mage ealle mine w\u00e6stmas\nEft he cw\u00e6\u00f0: ic wylle ryman minne bertun and mine bernu geeacnian and \u00f0ider gegaderian ealle mine\nGerest \u00fee nu and et and drinc and gewistfulla.\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 god to \u00feam rican: \u00f0u stunta, nu toniht \u00feu scealt \u00fein lif al\u00e6tan.\nHw\u00e6s beo\u00f0 \u00feonne \u00feine teolunga?\nSwa bi\u00f0, se \u00f0e him sylfum gold horda\u00f0 and nis on gode welig.\nEfne \u00feu ondr\u00e6tst \u00fee on \u00feam gedale; ne ondr\u00e6t \u00feu \u00fee to d\u00e6lenne, \u00feu \u00f0e nast, hw\u00e6\u00feer \u00f0u mergenes\nCy\u00f0 mildheortnesse earmum mannum mid \u00feinum begeatum; ne forl\u00e6t se \u00e6lmihtiga god \u00fee, se \u00f0e \u00fee to\nBe \u00feissum cw\u00e6\u00f0 drihten on his godspelle: ne behyde ge eowerne goldhord on eor\u00f0an, \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6r om and\nSo\u00f0lice, \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fein goldhord is, \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00f0 \u00fein heorte.\nHu mage we urne hord on heofonan behydon, buton \u00feurh \u00e6lmessan?\nSwa hw\u00e6t swa we be anfealdum godes \u00feearfum for his lufon sylla\u00f0, he hit us forgylt be hundfealdum\nGif ealle men on worulde rice w\u00e6ron, \u00feonne n\u00e6fde seo mildheortnys n\u00e6nne stede, \u00fe\u00e6t seo \u00e6lmesse\nNis nan \u00feearfa fram \u00e6lmesd\u00e6dum ascyred.\nWitodlice sum earm wydewe n\u00e6fde ealra \u00e6hta, buton \u00e6nne feor\u00f0linc, \u00feone heo brohte to godes\nEft on o\u00f0re stowe cw\u00e6\u00f0 drihten on his godspelle: swa hwa swa syl\u00f0 anum \u00feurstigum men ceald w\u00e6ter\nSo\u00f0lice ne bi\u00f0 us to \u00e6lmessan geteald, gyf we \u00feam mannum sylla\u00f0, \u00fee heora neode sylfe habba\u00f0,\nWe wylla\u00f0 \u00e6nne cwyde gyt \u00fe\u00e6re godspellican gerecednysse eow gereccan on \u00feissum ylcan andgyte.\nDrihten sp\u00e6c ymbe his tocyme to \u00feam micclum dome: witodlice mannes bearn cym\u00f0 on his\n\u00deonne geloga\u00f0 he \u00fea scep on his swy\u00f0ran hand and \u00f0a g\u00e6t on his wynstran.\nWe willa\u00f0 eow geswutelian nu \u00e6rest, gyf eower hwylc nyte, hw\u00e6t mannes bearn sy, \u00fe\u00e6t Crist sylf is\nAnd seo menniscnys by\u00f0 gesewen on \u00feam dome, \u00feonne he sylf sitt on his domsetle and \u00f0a rihtwisan\n\u00deonne cwy\u00f0 se cyning Crist to \u00feam, \u00fee on his swy\u00f0ran hand standa\u00f0: cuma\u00f0, ge gebletsode mines\nMe hingrode, and ge me gereordodon; me \u00feyrste, and ge me scencton; ic w\u00e6s cuma, and ge me\n\u00d0onne andswaria\u00f0 \u00fea rihtwisan Criste and cwe\u00fea\u00f0: drihten, hw\u00e6nne gesawe we \u00f0e hungrine, and we\nO\u00f0\u00f0e \u00feurstine, and we \u00f0e scencton?\nO\u00f0\u00f0e hw\u00e6nne w\u00e6re \u00feu cuma, and we \u00f0e underfengon?\nO\u00f0\u00f0e hw\u00e6nne gesawe we \u00f0e untrumne o\u00f0\u00f0e on cwearterne, and we \u00f0e geneosodon?\n\u00d0onne andwyrt se cyning \u00feam rihtwisan \u00feissum wordum: so\u00f0 ic eow secge, swa lange, swa ge dydon\n\u00d0onne cwy\u00f0 he eft to \u00feam synfullum, \u00fee on his wynstran healfe standa\u00f0: gewita\u00f0 fram me, ge\nMe hingrode, and ge me \u00e6tes forwyrndon; me \u00feyrste, and ge me drincan ne sealdon; ic w\u00e6s cuma,\n\u00d0onne andswaria\u00f0 \u00fea unrihtwisan manfullan: la leof, hw\u00e6nne gesawe we \u00f0e hungrine o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00feurstine\n\u00d0onne andwyrt se cyning heom and cwe\u00f0: so\u00f0 ic eow secge, swa lange, swa ge his forwyrndon anum\n\u00d0onne fara\u00f0 \u00fea uncystigan and \u00fea unrihtwisan into ecere cwicsusle mid deofle and his awyrgedum",
